powermon (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: recorder service, append-only time series store,
    stats / plot / svg / csv / now / info queries.
  * Recorder opens the RAPL perf counters as root, then runs as the
    "powermon" system user with no capabilities.
  * Flush requests from any local user through /run/powermon/flush.

